    "The accepted local cape finish preserves the blue folds, connected gold motif and curved hem without the former strict-mask seam. It uses the one actual local paint service in a bounded23295pixel cloth mask. All original visible cape alpha outside the original5113pixel pole-occluded region and all source/CORE pixels outside the allowed cloth mask remain exact.",
    "The visually detached metal flecks beside STRIKE/FOLLOW hands were traced to original shaft highlights/dark edges wrongly left in the foregrip input. Finalv04 moves all185 original RGBA texels to the complete rigid pole, preserving the actual fist/cuff and all other nodes. The former STRIKE fragments are absent; the remaining3pixel FOLLOW edge is the proper lower pole AA at inverse sourceUV408.9..410.88,533.89..534.17 rather than an old hand remnant.",
    "All36 actual editable node rasters reproduce the six final sources exactly. The original stationary sole/lowerboot capture patches are unchanged; the common C2816/bodyunit2.75/root and transparent storage offset are fixed. The six distinct sources retain a coherent fixed-heel braced stance through torso weight shift and recovery."
  ],
